<ParahumanWikiLayout>
  <div slot="title">The Haribon Foundation</div>
  <div class="warning">EXTREMELY DANGEROUS - DO NOT APPROACH</div>

  <p>The Haribon Foundation is an unregistered charity organisation and violent eco-terrorist villain group.</p>
  <p>Before its seizure by the capes Carrion Call, Sawa, and Recycler, the Haribon Foundation was a legitimate
  environmental charity. The organisation now focuses on political assassinations and violent attacks on mining,
  deforestation, and construction projects.</p>
  <p>Haribon generally operates outside of the Fort, but makes appearances within the walls for assassinations
  and terror attacks.</p>

  <h2>Known Members</h2>
  <h3>Carrion Call</h3>
  <p>The exact mechanics of Carrion Call's powers are unknown, but she always seems to attack first 
  with a throwing knife, arrow, or gun, and then seemingly controlling various animals to attack the wounded person.
  Carrion Call has several pets that she brings into battle - most notably a Phillipine Eagle and two monitor lizards.</p>
  </p>
  <h3>Sawa</h3>
  <p>Sawa uses and controls a length of metal chain tipped with long blades.</p>
  <h3>Recycler</h3>
  <section class="embeddedImageSection">
    <p>Recycler is a tinker who seems to specialise in repurposing technology. His largest and most dangerous creation
    is a giant mech suit made out of a decommissioned RWE Bagger 288 excavator.</p>
    <div class="embeddedImage">
      <img src={bagger} />
      <p>A Bagger 288 Excavator. Note the people on the ground for scale.</p>
    </div>
  <section>
</ParahumanWikiLayout>
